      "\"Look, Gretel!\" Hansel cries. \"Let's eat!\"",
      "Hansel eats a piece of the wall, and Gretel eats a piece of the sugar window. Suddenly, the door opens and a very old woman walks out.",
      "Hansel and Gretel are afraid, but the old woman smiles. \"Come inside, dear children. You can stay in my house.\"",
      "She leads them inside and gives them delicious food. They eat and sleep in two warm beds.",
      "But the old woman is a bad witch! She builds houses of cake to catch children. When they come, she cooks and eats them.",
      "Early the next morning, the witch locks Hansel inside a small iron stable. She runs to Gretel and shouts, \"You must cook food for your brother. I want to make him fat. When he is fat, I will eat him!\"",
      "Gretel cries, but she must obey. Every morning, the witch goes to the stable. Her eyes are bad. She says, \"Hansel, put out your finger. I want to feel if you are fat.\"",
      "But Hansel puts out a small chicken bone. The witch touches the bone and thinks, \"Why is he still so thin?\"",
      "After four weeks, the witch cannot wait anymore. \"Gretel! Bring water! Tomorrow I will cook Hansel!\"",
      "The next morning, Gretel must build a big fire in the oven. The witch wants to cook Gretel, too.",
      "She says, \"Crawl inside the oven. See if it is hot enough.\"",
      "Gretel knows the witch's bad plan. She says, \"I do not know how. The opening is too small.\"",
      "\"You silly goose!\" the witch shouts. \"The opening is big! Look, even I can fit!\"",
      "The witch puts her head inside the oven opening. Quickly, Gretel runs and gives the witch a big push! The witch falls deep into the hot oven! Gretel quickly shuts the heavy iron door and locks it. The witch dies in the fire.",
      "Gretel runs to the stable. \"Hansel! We are free! The witch is dead!\"",
      "Gretel opens the door, and Hansel jumps out. They find boxes of gold and pearls in the house. Hansel fills his pockets with gold, and Gretel fills her apron with pearls.",
