      "Once upon a time, there is a young boy named Jack. Jack lives with his mother in a small house in the countryside. They are very poor. They only have a small garden and a cow named Milky White.",
      "Milky White is a good cow. Every day, Milky White gives sweet white milk. Jack and his mother sell the milk at the market to buy bread. They are poor, but they are happy together.",
