      "Once upon a time, there is a beautiful, warm summer in the countryside. The fields are yellow with wheat, and the grass is green and soft. Near an old river, a mother duck is sitting on her nest. She has six small, smooth eggs and one very big, grey egg.",
      "Mother duck is very tired. She sits on her eggs for a long time. \"I want my babies to wake up,\" she says. \"They are inside their shells for so many days.\"",
