      "Autumn comes. The green leaves become yellow and brown. The wind blows them from the trees. The sky is dark and grey.",
      "One evening, a group of beautiful large birds flies out of the bushes. They have long, elegant white necks and giant white wings. They make a beautiful, loud sound. They fly high into the sky, going to the warm south countries.",
