      "Once upon a time, there is a very special town. The name of the town is Clockwork Town. Clockwork Town is beautiful and clean. The streets are made of grey stones. The houses are small and have red roofs.",
      "But Clockwork Town is not a normal town. In this town, everything is kurmalı. In English, we say clockwork. This means everything works with keys and gears.",
