      "Mia looks up into the tallest pine tree. High in the branches, she sees a very big nest made of twigs and dry grass.",
      "\"The nest is very high,\" Mia says. \"I cannot climb this tree. It is too tall and dangerous.\"",
      "She looks at Tick-Tock in her arms. \"I need your help, Tick-Tock. But you have no power.\"",
      "Suddenly, Mia sees a small keyhole on a wooden post near the tree. It is a public winding station! In Clockwork Town, there are small winding stations on the streets.",
