      "Oliver felt very happy. He loved to paint dreams. He loved to see the happy faces of his neighbors.",
      "One evening, a terrible thing happens. A heavy grey fog rolls down from the high mountains. The fog is very thick and cold. It covers the whole village like a dark blanket.",
