      "Oliver looks out the window. He sees the dark, grey streets. He wants to help his village.",
      "\"I must paint the sun,\" Oliver says to his black cat, Brush. Brush meows in agreement. \"I will paint a giant, bright, golden sun with long warm rays. The sun will destroy the grey fog!\"",
      "Oliver runs to his table. He gets his magic brush. He opens his paint box.",
      "But when he looks inside, his heart sinks.",
